  "paragraph": 35,
  "text": "Pull all six pillars together, and the entire field compresses into one clean operating system mental model that transfers whether you are building a coding, browser, research, or operations agent. The language model is the CPU, delivering raw reasoning power. The context window is RAM, fast and finite working memory. The filesystem and git history act as durable disk across sessions. Tools, lifecycle hooks, and sandboxes form the kernel and input-output boundary. And unit tests, linters, and trajectory evals serve as the debugger keeping the whole machine honest.",
